# Taskmaster: Architecture & Conventions (unified)

Single reference for this repo. No other .md docs; everything lives here.

---

## Project identity & stack

- **Backend:** Flask (Python), Railway. **DB/Auth/Storage:** Supabase. **AI:** OpenAI (Whisper + GPT-4o-mini). **Email:** Resend.
- **Frontend:** Separate app; `FRONTEND_URL` in config (e.g. app.willonski.com or localhost:3000).

---

## Layout

- **Routes:** `routes/auth.py`, `session.py`, `questions.py`, `recordings.py`, `user.py`, `admin.py` (legacy/v1); **`routes/homework.py`** → **`/v2/homework/*`** (only student flow); **`routes/v2_routes.py`** → **`/v2/admin/*`** (admin only).
- **Data:** `services/db.py` (all Supabase), `services/openai_service.py`, `services/email_service.py`. Config: `config.py` only.
- **Homework:** session start/status, warm-up, recording_1, metric-answers, recording_2, questions, post-answers. DB: `homework_sessions`, warm_up_tasks, task_block, metric_questions, post_recording_questions (see `migrations/v2_all_in_one.sql`).

---

## Setup & running

- **Install:** `pip install -r requirements.txt`
- **Env:** Copy `.env.example` to `.env`. Required: `SUPABASE_URL`, `SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`, `SUPABASE_JWT_SECRET`, `OPENAI_API_KEY`, `RESEND_API_KEY`, `RESEND_FROM_EMAIL`, `ADMIN_EMAIL`, `FRONTEND_URL`. Optional: `SENTRY_DSN`, `ENV`, `SEND_EMAILS`, `INTRO_0_VIDEO_URL`, `INTRO_0_DESCRIPTION` (step 0 intro video when DB has none).
- **Run:** `python app.py` (local). Railway: set env in dashboard; Procfile used.
- **Migrations:** Run **`migrations/v2_all_in_one.sql`** in Supabase SQL Editor (idempotent). Then run coaching migrations in order: **`add_v2_student_coaching_memory.sql`**, **`add_recording_1_performance_profile.sql`**, **`add_recurring_issues_to_coaching_memory.sql`**, **`add_focus_task_targets_and_difficulty.sql`**. Then **`add_tutor_feedback_deadline.sql`** (adds `completed_at`; required for step 4→5) and **`add_tutor_feedback_sent_at.sql`**. Run **`seed_intro_0_exercise.sql`** so the default step-0 exercise **"0-intro"** exists; set its **video_url** (and **description**) in Admin → Exercises so the homework page shows the video (default Vimeo link is in config). For security (RLS): run **`migrations/enable_rls_public_tables.sql`** so PostgREST/anon key cannot read/write tables; backend uses **SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY** and bypasses RLS. Then Settings → API → Reload schema cache if available. Full flow checklist and performance: **`docs/HOMEWORK-AND-PERFORMANCE.md`**.

